(7483569, 1190756, 114285, '<td valign="top">So much potential in this shot, but I have to say it''s really ruined by the editing or, maybe it''s due to the lack of sharpness. The clouds look unrealistic, there are strange artifacts in the sky, the boats look cartoonish also, and the water a little rough. But like I said this had huge potential, because the scene is gorgeous!</td>', 'So much potential in this shot, but I have to say it''s really ruined by the editing or, maybe it''s due to the lack of sharpness. The clouds look unrealistic, there are strange artifacts in the sky, the boats look cartoonish also, and the water a little rough. But like I said this had huge potential, because the scene is gorgeous!', '2016-11-21 22:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
