(7484393, 1190493, 100393, '<td valign="top">There''s just something about this that grabs me - it''s an authentic moment, perfectly captured. I''ve only seen that in the work of Nick Hinch previously. <br/> <br/>The foot, the print-out adds compositional chaos to precise focused lovely natural coloration.<br/> <br/>Bumping to a 10.</td>', 'There''s just something about this that grabs me - it''s an authentic moment, perfectly captured. I''ve only seen that in the work of Nick Hinch previously.  The foot, the print-out adds compositional chaos to precise focused lovely natural coloration. Bumping to a 10.', '2016-11-27 16:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484394, 1190889, 100393, '<td valign="top">Brilliant contrast, wonderful height and the perfect moment. I love this, bumping to a 10.</td>', 'Brilliant contrast, wonderful height and the perfect moment. I love this, bumping to a 10.', '2016-11-27 16:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484395, 1190848, 100393, '<td valign="top">Normally not my sort of image but the joining of sky and earth and the mediating clouds  grabs me.<br/> <br/>Very well made.</td>', 'Normally not my sort of image but the joining of sky and earth and the mediating clouds  grabs me. Very well made.', '2016-11-27 16:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484396, 1190907, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for such shots - lovely softness and muted colours. An image I wish I''d made myself. Bumping to a 9.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for such shots - lovely softness and muted colours. An image I wish I''d made myself. Bumping to a 9.', '2016-11-27 16:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484397, 1190940, 100393, '<td valign="top">Brilliant near symmetry; what an eclectic trio.</td>', 'Brilliant near symmetry; what an eclectic trio.', '2016-11-27 16:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484398, 1190334, 100393, '<td valign="top">Cool and graphic. Well visualised from exposure to presentation.<br/> <br/>(Voted days ago)</td>', 'Cool and graphic. Well visualised from exposure to presentation. (Voted days ago)', '2016-11-27 16:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484400, 1190994, 100393, '<td valign="top">Great moment of capture - loads of energy, transferred all the way through to the viewer.<br/> <br/>(Voted days ago)</td>', 'Great moment of capture - loads of energy, transferred all the way through to the viewer. (Voted days ago)', '2016-11-27 16:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484401, 1190811, 100393, '<td valign="top">Brave and minimalist in presentation - I love how this doesn''t rely of fidelity for its impact. The expression has the power of ambiguity.<br/> <br/>Masterfully presented - bumping to a 9.</td>', 'Brave and minimalist in presentation - I love how this doesn''t rely of fidelity for its impact. The expression has the power of ambiguity. Masterfully presented - bumping to a 9.', '2016-11-27 16:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484403, 1190917, 115814, '<td valign="top">This is terrific. What a wonderful tableau. Really makes me curious about the context! Outstanding processing, too!</td>', 'This is terrific. What a wonderful tableau. Really makes me curious about the context! Outstanding processing, too!', '2016-11-27 16:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484404, 1190620, 100393, '<td valign="top">Interesting and bold - perhaps too bold - it jars a little; but I appreciate being prodded as a viewer.<br/> <br/>(Voted days ago)</td>', 'Interesting and bold - perhaps too bold - it jars a little; but I appreciate being prodded as a viewer. (Voted days ago)', '2016-11-27 16:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484405, 1190477, 100393, '<td valign="top">Very well constructed portrait.<br/> <br/>(Voted days ago)</td>', 'Very well constructed portrait. (Voted days ago)', '2016-11-27 16:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484406, 1190924, 115814, '<td valign="top">Remarkable sense of place and atmosphere.</td>', 'Remarkable sense of place and atmosphere.', '2016-11-27 16:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484407, 1190934, 115814, '<td valign="top">Evocative. Action is well-reflected in the processing.</td>', 'Evocative. Action is well-reflected in the processing.', '2016-11-27 16:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484408, 1190851, 100393, '<td valign="top">I don''t know about the skin smoothing but I do like how it is juxtaposed with the textured hat. This has a very artsy feel that I enjoy more on this second viewing. Bumping to a 9.</td>', 'I don''t know about the skin smoothing but I do like how it is juxtaposed with the textured hat. This has a very artsy feel that I enjoy more on this second viewing. Bumping to a 9.', '2016-11-27 16:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484409, 1190992, 100393, '<td valign="top">More than the sum of its parts. The low POV, the colour, the light, the somewhat soft focus - this evokes a sense of being there. Bumping to an 8.</td>', 'More than the sum of its parts. The low POV, the colour, the light, the somewhat soft focus - this evokes a sense of being there. Bumping to an 8.', '2016-11-27 16:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484410, 1191008, 115814, '<td valign="top">Hauntingly emotional portrait.</td>', 'Hauntingly emotional portrait.', '2016-11-27 16:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484411, 1190935, 100393, '<td valign="top">Wonderful scene, great detail and lovely colours - I perhaps wish for a little more room on the left but this is a very pretty shot.<br/> <br/>(Voted days ago)</td>', 'Wonderful scene, great detail and lovely colours - I perhaps wish for a little more room on the left but this is a very pretty shot. (Voted days ago)', '2016-11-27 16:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484412, 1190422, 100393, '<td valign="top">Looks like a classic Mark shot - you really do nail these.<br/> <br/>(Voted days ago)</td>', 'Looks like a classic Mark shot - you really do nail these. (Voted days ago)', '2016-11-27 16:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484413, 1190908, 115814, '<td valign="top">Disorienting and compelling. Can''t look away.</td>', 'Disorienting and compelling. Can''t look away.', '2016-11-27 16:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484414, 1190475, 100393, '<td valign="top">A familiar subject, well captured. Here you offer a sense of foreboding that I enjoy.<br/> <br/>(Voted days ago)</td>', 'A familiar subject, well captured. Here you offer a sense of foreboding that I enjoy. (Voted days ago)', '2016-11-27 16:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484415, 1190448, 100393, '<td valign="top">Great scene, well captured.<br/> <br/>(Voted days ago)</td>', 'Great scene, well captured. (Voted days ago)', '2016-11-27 16:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484416, 1190760, 115814, '<td valign="top">Much darker these days...</td>', 'Much darker these days...', '2016-11-27 16:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484417, 1190386, 100393, '<td valign="top">Sad and dramatic, the bare feet clueing us in that this must be a warm scene and those white patches are patches of sunlight, not patches of snow as I first thought.<br/> <br/>Compelling.<br/> <br/>(Voted days ago)</td>', 'Sad and dramatic, the bare feet clueing us in that this must be a warm scene and those white patches are patches of sunlight, not patches of snow as I first thought. Compelling. (Voted days ago)', '2016-11-27 16:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484419, 1190900, 115814, '<td valign="top">I love the dark hair shape echoed in the rusting background behind the peeling image. Great find, amplified by context at the edges.</td>', 'I love the dark hair shape echoed in the rusting background behind the peeling image. Great find, amplified by context at the edges.', '2016-11-27 16:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484420, 1190934, 100393, '<td valign="top">Chaotic, bold - this captures a sense of a fleeting moment that will never be seen again. I know all photographs technically do that, but here the sense of that is palpable.<br/> <br/>(Voted days ago)</td>', 'Chaotic, bold - this captures a sense of a fleeting moment that will never be seen again. I know all photographs technically do that, but here the sense of that is palpable. (Voted days ago)', '2016-11-27 16:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484421, 1190293, 115814, '<td valign="top">Just the right DOF, blurring the emotion and clarity behind the glass.</td>', 'Just the right DOF, blurring the emotion and clarity behind the glass.', '2016-11-27 16:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484422, 1190475, 115814, '<td valign="top">So many shapes in the larger context here. Nice isolation creating a well-balanced image, further enhanced by the clouds. One of the better takes on this iconic building I''ve seen.</td>', 'So many shapes in the larger context here. Nice isolation creating a well-balanced image, further enhanced by the clouds. One of the better takes on this iconic building I''ve seen.', '2016-11-27 16:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484423, 1190900, 100831, '<td valign="top">I find this fascinating. And very well composed. Great seeing.</td>', 'I find this fascinating. And very well composed. Great seeing.', '2016-11-27 16:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484424, 1190811, 100831, '<td valign="top">Beautiful toning. A classic feel.  Love it.</td>', 'Beautiful toning. A classic feel.  Love it.', '2016-11-27 16:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484425, 1190923, 115814, '<td valign="top">Lovely color palette and effective processing for the subject.</td>', 'Lovely color palette and effective processing for the subject.', '2016-11-27 16:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
