(7484562, 1190963, 71489, '<td valign="top">I love street shots. This one has a lot of story in it. Nice environmental portrait. The blur doesn''t work in your favor though.</td>', 'I love street shots. This one has a lot of story in it. Nice environmental portrait. The blur doesn''t work in your favor though.', '2016-11-27 20:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484563, 1190917, 30861, '<td valign="top">Straight out of Walker Evans. Have you read "Let us Now Praise Famous Men"? If nor, please do :-) 9 from me.</td>', 'Straight out of Walker Evans. Have you read "Let us Now Praise Famous Men"? If nor, please do :-) 9 from me.', '2016-11-27 20:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484564, 1190986, 115814, '<td valign="top">An odd image, this one. Complex, busy, and holding surprise on deeper inspection. Just not sure if the payoff is enough to warrant the rest of the chaos... but, I <i>could</i> be convinced. Mixed feelings.</td>', 'An odd image, this one. Complex, busy, and holding surprise on deeper inspection. Just not sure if the payoff is enough to warrant the rest of the chaos... but, I could be convinced. Mixed feelings.', '2016-11-27 20:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484565, 1190744, 30861, '<td valign="top">The DOF and the B/W processing are both immaculate here. The character looks rather enigmatic. I see compassion, and I see aloofness. I admire the image, and gave it a 9.</td>', 'The DOF and the B/W processing are both immaculate here. The character looks rather enigmatic. I see compassion, and I see aloofness. I admire the image, and gave it a 9.', '2016-11-27 20:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484566, 1190408, 30861, '<td valign="top">Technically, this ain''t all that: The light zones are half a stop to a stop blown, and the effect is not what I''d want it to be. But the image is nevertheless arresting, and I keep coming back to it.I like that only one foot of the four is grounded. I worry about the boy leaping in his thongs, which aren''t the most stable of footwear. I want to know the backstory here. And for that I gave it a 9.</td>', 'Technically, this ain''t all that: The light zones are half a stop to a stop blown, and the effect is not what I''d want it to be. But the image is nevertheless arresting, and I keep coming back to it.I like that only one foot of the four is grounded. I worry about the boy leaping in his thongs, which aren''t the most stable of footwear. I want to know the backstory here. And for that I gave it a 9.', '2016-11-27 20:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484567, 1191000, 71489, '<td valign="top">A bit too saturated in my opinion.</td>', 'A bit too saturated in my opinion.', '2016-11-27 20:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484568, 1190308, 115814, '<td valign="top">The classic "S" curve leading to... either a background mountain with little specific interest;  or four non-decript cars including one in the far left foreground partially out of the frame. There''s beautiful technical work here, but to what end?</td>', 'The classic "S" curve leading to... either a background mountain with little specific interest;  or four non-decript cars including one in the far left foreground partially out of the frame. There''s beautiful technical work here, but to what end?', '2016-11-27 20:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484569, 1190947, 71489, '<td valign="top">Excellent! A bit higher saturation would''ve really done wonders.</td>', 'Excellent! A bit higher saturation would''ve really done wonders.', '2016-11-27 20:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484570, 1190942, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is one of my highest scores; I gave it a 9. The embrace of stone and root is tangible metaphor of the power of life. I find the image gripping, and no pun is intended. You could have processed it with a tad more density and enhanced the power even more, but it''s a fine and well-seen image. I gave you a 9.</td>', 'This is one of my highest scores; I gave it a 9. The embrace of stone and root is tangible metaphor of the power of life. I find the image gripping, and no pun is intended. You could have processed it with a tad more density and enhanced the power even more, but it''s a fine and well-seen image. I gave you a 9.', '2016-11-27 20:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484571, 1190843, 71489, '<td valign="top">The orange cloth adds a new dimension to the color in this photo.</td>', 'The orange cloth adds a new dimension to the color in this photo.', '2016-11-27 20:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484572, 1190983, 115814, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and effective rim light at the top - but with a classic subject like this that''s been done before, I long for something new. The blown out highlights where the light hits the ground becomes the unfortunate central point of attention.</td>', 'Lovely colors and effective rim light at the top - but with a classic subject like this that''s been done before, I long for something new. The blown out highlights where the light hits the ground becomes the unfortunate central point of attention.', '2016-11-27 20:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484573, 1190811, 30861, '<td valign="top">Utterly timeless. I keep returning to it. I am distracted by the little light spot upper left, and by a bit too much of nothing at the bottom, but these are quibbles. I want to know her. I want to hear her story. I gave this a 9.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2016-11-28 08:50:23.</i></td>', 'Utterly timeless. I keep returning to it. I am distracted by the little light spot upper left, and by a bit too much of nothing at the bottom, but these are quibbles. I want to know her. I want to hear her story. I gave this a 9.', '2016-11-27 20:50:25.000000', '2016-11-28 08:50:23.000000', 1),
(7484574, 1190889, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is the Venezia I know and love. a 9 from me.</td>', 'This is the Venezia I know and love. a 9 from me.', '2016-11-27 20:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484575, 1190775, 30861, '<td valign="top">There''s a primitive sort of power here; the image reeks of it. The arc of grey is most felicitous. The composition is a bit too static and working against the power of the image, I think.</td>', 'There''s a primitive sort of power here; the image reeks of it. The arc of grey is most felicitous. The composition is a bit too static and working against the power of the image, I think.', '2016-11-27 20:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484576, 1190918, 115814, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous color and textures with raking light accentuating all the right things. I might consider cropping the left side and the top to focus on a single ridge line.</td>', 'Gorgeous color and textures with raking light accentuating all the right things. I might consider cropping the left side and the top to focus on a single ridge line.', '2016-11-27 20:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484577, 1190987, 115814, '<td valign="top">Clever use of an overused technique. Nice.</td>', 'Clever use of an overused technique. Nice.', '2016-11-27 20:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
