(7484585, 1191003, 71489, '<td valign="top">While I''m sure this may have been difficult to get, there''s still lots of room for improvement. Sharpness could be more, could be less noisier, composition (too zoomed in), Colors could''ve been more saturated. Perhaps it''s just your gear''s limitation.<br/>Keep at it!</td>', 'While I''m sure this may have been difficult to get, there''s still lots of room for improvement. Sharpness could be more, could be less noisier, composition (too zoomed in), Colors could''ve been more saturated. Perhaps it''s just your gear''s limitation.Keep at it!', '2016-11-27 21:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484586, 1190914, 71489, '<td valign="top">Somehow, apocalypse and lovely blue and green colors don''t go together. I think the reduced vibrance an saturation in the PP could''ve really help this photo. Good composition nonetheless.</td>', 'Somehow, apocalypse and lovely blue and green colors don''t go together. I think the reduced vibrance an saturation in the PP could''ve really help this photo. Good composition nonetheless.', '2016-11-27 21:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
