(7484737, 1190408, 1686, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the votes and comments <br/> <br/>These are two novices in Mingun Myanmar <br/>Young boys often are sent to a monastery for short periods of time where they get educated.<br/>They don''t necessarily become monks and they are still like other young boys.<br/>So it''s not unusual to see them horsing around and mugging it up for the camera, as were these two.</td>', 'Thanks for all the votes and comments  These are two novices in Mingun Myanmar Young boys often are sent to a monastery for short periods of time where they get educated.They don''t necessarily become monks and they are still like other young boys.So it''s not unusual to see them horsing around and mugging it up for the camera, as were these two.', '2016-11-28 00:12:49.000000', NULL, 0),
