(7485045, 1190848, 86447, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your HM!  <br/> <br/>This is a fabulous image... I love it that you''ve caught a "shooting star".<br/> <br/>Oddly, though... I''d have cropped the image just below that... to really make it about that dreamy place between heaven and earth that you''ve captured.<br/> <br/>I think it gets a bit lost with all of the stuff up top making it all about the stuff up top.  :D<br/> <br/></td>', 'Congratulations on your HM!   This is a fabulous image... I love it that you''ve caught a "shooting star". Oddly, though... I''d have cropped the image just below that... to really make it about that dreamy place between heaven and earth that you''ve captured. I think it gets a bit lost with all of the stuff up top making it all about the stuff up top.  :D ', '2016-11-29 21:00:00.000000', NULL, 0),
